                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_core" value="&lt;b&gt;gateway-core (one service layer)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. validate JWT, build principal&amp;nbsp;(groups, clearance, department)&lt;br&gt;2. hybrid search: pgvector cosine + full-text, reciprocal rank fusion, similarity floor, one chunk/object&lt;br&gt;3. graph templates (read-only session)&lt;br&gt;4. coarse pre-filter in SQL and Cypher&lt;br&gt;5. fine post-check of one ACL rule&lt;br&gt;6. row-level security&lt;br&gt;7. audit row names the attributes&lt;br&gt;8. HR policy: live ACL re-check&amp;nbsp;at the harness, fail closed&lt;br&gt;9. wrap snippet as untrusted data" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1061B0;strokeColor=#0B4884;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;arcSize=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
